OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge boss resigns as chain
OL,4,Atackles security after sex assault at
OL,5,Ahotel
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe boss of Travelodge, Jo Boydell, has
OL,8,Fstepped down as the group addresses
OL,9,Fsafety issues after a sexual assault at
OL,10,Fone of its hotels.
OL,12,FA woman staying at a hotel in
OL,13,FMaidenhead was sexually assaulted in
OL,14,FDecember 2022 after a man lied to staff
OL,15,Fto get a key card to her room. Kyran
OL,16,FSmith was jailed for more than seven
OL,17,Fyears for the attack.
OL,19,FMany people have since contacted the
OL,20,FBBC over room security incidents at
OL,21,FTravelodges and a review of security
OL,22,Fmeasures at the firm is under way.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,338,330,200,160,0,100
