OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge boss resigns as chain
OL,4,Atackles security after sex assault at
OL,5,Ahotel
OL,6,
OL,7,FBoydell had been criticised for the
OL,8,Ffirm's handling of safety issues. She
OL,9,Fsaid she only heard about the assault
OL,10,Fyears after it had happened, although
OL,11,Fit emerged the victim had emailed her
OL,12,Fshortly after the attack.
